---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutImage from '../assets/images/about.png';
import '../styles/about.scss';
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2 class="about-title">About</h2>
      <p class="about-text">
        Hi, I’m Emma s’Jacob, experienced violinist, educator, qualified wellbeing coach and sole founder of Bravura coaching. I’ve played and taught violin for over 25 years, privately, in schools and in orchestras across the world. I believe in nurturing the soul and reigniting brain function through instrumental music tuition. It is well documented that exposure to music, whether through listening or playing, preserves and restores cognitive agility and helps to stave off the corrosive effects of neurodegenerative diseases. Come and experience the therapeutic power of music through string-playing.
      </p>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>Start from scratch</li>
        <li>Resume practice after a hiatus period</li>
        <li>Pick up where you left off from childhood</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="about-text">
        My tuition/coaching packages offer Violin, Viola and Cello online classes together with one to one sessions at my beautiful Deal based hub. Be inspired and soothed by the studio’s sea views. Prices and packages are outlined below - bespoke packages welcomed. I look forward to hearing your story and setting it to music.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-image">
      <Image src={aboutImage} alt="About Bravura Coaching" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
